## 📚 EJEMPLOS DE REFERENCIA

### Hero Section
```tsx
<section className="relative bg-azul-marino py-20 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Elementos decorativos (MAX 3) */}
  <div className="absolute top-20 right-[10%] w-32 h-32 
                  bg-turquesa/10 rounded-2xl rotate-12 
                  animate-float-slow" />
  <div className="absolute bottom-40 left-[15%] w-24 h-24 
                  bg-menta/10 rounded-2xl -rotate-6 
                  animate-float" />
  <div className="absolute top-[60%] right-[20%] w-16 h-16 
                  bg-violeta/10 rounded-2xl rotate-45 
                  animate-pulse" />
  
  <div className="container-custom relative z-10">
    <motion.div 
      initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 40 }}
      animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
      transition={{ duration: 0.8 }}
      className="max-w-3xl"
    >
      <h1 className="text-display text-white font-semibold mb-6">
        Impulsamos tu empresa 
        <span className="text-turquesa block mt-2">
          estratégicamente
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p className="text-body-lg text-white/80 mb-8">
        Brindamos soluciones empresariales completas en consultoría...
      </p>
      <button className="bg-turquesa text-azul-marino font-semibold 
                         px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-menta 
                         transition-all duration-300 
                         shadow-glow-turquesa">
        Conoce Más
      </button>
    </motion.div>
  </div>
</section>
```

### Services Grid
```tsx
<section className="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white">
  <div className="container-custom">
    <div className="text-center mb-12">
      <span className="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-turquesa/10 
                       text-turquesa rounded-full text-sm 
                       font-medium mb-4">
        Nuestros Servicios
      </span>
      <h2 className="text-heading text-azul-marino font-semibold">
        Soluciones Integrales
      </h2>
    </div>
    
    <div className="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {services.map((service, index) => (
        <motion.div
          key={service.id}
          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
          transition={{ delay: index * 0.1 }}
          viewport={{ once: true }}
          className="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 
                     shadow-brand hover:shadow-brand-lg 
                     transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 
                     overflow-hidden"
        >
          {/* Elemento decorativo */}
          <div className="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 
                          bg-turquesa/10 rounded-lg rotate-12 
                          group-hover:rotate-45 
                          transition-transform duration-500" />
          
          <div className="relative z-10">
            <div className="w-14 h-14 bg-turquesa/20 rounded-xl 
                            flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <service.Icon className="w-7 h-7 text-turquesa" />
            </div>
            <h3 className="text-subheading text-azul-marino 
                           font-semibold mb-3">
              {service.title}
            </h3>
            <p className="text-body text-azul-marino/70">
              {service.description}
            </p>
          </div>
        </motion.div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

### Testimonials
```tsx
<section className="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-azul-marino">
  <div className="container-custom">
    <h2 className="text-heading text-white font-semibold 
                   text-center mb-12">
      Lo que dicen nuestros 
      <span className="text-turquesa block mt-2">clientes</span>
    </h2>
    
    <div className="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {testimonials.map((testimonial) => (
        <div key={testimonial.id} 
             className="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl 
                        p-6 border border-white/20">
          <p className="text-body text-white/90 mb-4">
            "{testimonial.quote}"
          </p>
          <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
            <Image 
              src={testimonial.avatar} 
              className="w-12 h-12 rounded-full"
            />
            <div>
              <p className="text-body-sm text-white font-semibold">
                {testimonial.name}
              </p>
              <p className="text-body-sm text-white/70">
                {testimonial.role}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

